  "conclusion": "P7-A remains incomplete and is stopped after the bounded 1e-6 follow-up. On the one 30-second utterance, 1e-3/1e-5/1e-6 required 26/92/464 Score calls and 15.74/45.55/174.03 seconds. The 1e-3 to 1e-5 waveform/complex-STFT relative L2 difference was about 7.56%; the 1e-5 to 1e-6 difference was about 0.399%, still above the planned 1e-3 threshold. The 1e-7 solve exceeded the 15-minute compute-cost gate, and the other three utterances were not run. No convergence or accuracy conclusion is supported. Code audit found a complex128 SciPy state re-cast to complex64 in each model callback, a plausible but unquantified precision floor. Do not run further strict-tolerance integrations until a separately bounded precision-path experiment is justified.",
